      },
      "text": "```\n  Normalized number: x = +/- 1.f * 2^e\n  where f is the 52-bit fraction and e = exponent - 1023 (bias)"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-FLOATING-POINT.md#009",
      "path": [
        "01-FLOATING-POINT.md"
