        "title": "Floating-Point Arithmetic",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Subnormal numbers: gradual underflow near 0\n  x = +/- 0.f * 2^{-1022}  (no leading 1)\n  Allow gradual loss of precision near 0; avoid hard underflow to 0."
    },
    {
      "id": "01-FLOATING-POINT.md#010",
      "path": [
