      },
      "text": "Special values:\n  +inf, -inf: overflow or division by nonzero / 0\n  NaN (Not a Number): 0/0, inf - inf, sqrt(-1), etc.\n  +0 and -0: same value, different bit pattern. (+0 == -0 is true)"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-FLOATING-POINT.md#011",
      "path": [
        "01-FLOATING-POINT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
