        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Floating-Point Arithmetic",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "IEEE GUARANTEES:\n  Each basic operation (+, -, *, /, sqrt) is \"correctly rounded\":\n  fl(x op y) = round(x op y)  where round rounds to nearest representable float.\n  This is the EXACT rounding guarantee — critical for reproducibility.\n```"
    },
